id: GQL-013
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Deeply nested array type
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .graphql .gql
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: type
patterns:
  - regex: \w+:\s*\[\[\[
    message: "Triple-nested array in GraphQL schema — deep nesting indicates schema design issue"
fix: Flatten the structure using named types. Example — instead of [[[String]]] use a dedicated type with meaningful fields.
